<& /page/page_title.mas, title => "CytoScape 互作組檢視器(CytoScape Interactome Viewer)" &>


這是一個設計用於預載入咖啡互作組數據的 CytoScape Java Web Start 應用程式。若要使用此應用程式，請點擊下方的「啟動 CytoScape」按鈕，這將下載設定檔並從瀏覽器載入 Java 應用程式。應用程式本身不會安裝在您的電腦上，但您將獲得完整的 Cytoscape 功能，並能夠檢視、處理、編輯和儲存顯示的網路。(This is a CytoScape Java Web Start app designed to preload with the coffee interactome data. In order to use this app, please click the Launch Cytoscape button below, which will download the configuration file and load the java app from your browser. The application itself will not be installed on your computer, but you should get full Cytoscape functionality, and be able to view, process, edit, and save the network shown.)



<center><form method="get" action="/tools/interactomics/coffee.jnlp" >
<input type="hidden" name="Network" value = "http://andrew.sgn.cornell.edu:3000/CytoScape/coffee.cys" />
<input type="submit" value="啟動 CytoScape(Launch CytoScape)" align = "center" /> 
</form></center>


	
